# Ninja Teen level 3 gives the graveyard Turncoat Kunoichi sneak {3}{B} (CR 702.190a, 113.6), a sneak the card does not have itself: "if its sneak cost was paid" is true for it
# (CR 702.190a), so its trigger exiles the chosen creature for good. Bot1 casts Kunoichi normally on turn 5 (no creature to choose, so no trigger), Bot2 bolts it on turn 6
# and casts a Memnite, and on turn 7 the graveyard Kunoichi is sneaked in for {3}{B}, returning the attacking Ornithopter, and exiles the Memnite. Bot2 bolts the Kunoichi again
# on turn 8, and the Memnite stays in exile.

